 * the source's ideas, never a verbatim translation. Runnable design: corr2d
 * on the book's exact 3x3/2x2 grid (19/25/37/43), the 6x8 edge-detector
 * image with kernel [1,-1], the transposed-image check, and the output-shape
 * rule. Every literal verified under CPython 3. Deterministic only: no
 * input(), no exit(), no unittest.main.
 */
