        en: 'Implement corr2d(X, K) — two-dimensional cross-correlation over nested lists — then apply it: first to the book\u2019s 3\u00d73 grid with kernel [[0,1],[2,3]], and second as a vertical edge detector on a 6\u00d78 image (two white columns, four black, two white) with kernel [[1,\u22121]].',
