      solution: "def corr2d(X, K):\n    kh, kw = len(K), len(K[0])\n    nh, nw = len(X), len(X[0])\n    return [[sum(X[i + a][j + b] * K[a][b] for a in range(kh) for b in range(kw))\n             for j in range(nw - kw + 1)] for i in range(nh - kh + 1)]",
